     1,
     "<div><div style=\"color:#000;background-color:#fff;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><div><span>Oi Luciano,</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><span>se vc estiver interessado em trabalhar com as coordenadas geográficas, </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">transforma-las entre diferentes projeções</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> e montar mapas, dê uma olhada nessas funções/pacotes:</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><span><br></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><span>- coordinates/sp</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><span>- </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">proj4string/sp</span></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><span>- </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">spplot/sp</span></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><span>- project/rgdal</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><span>- </span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">spTransform/rgdal</span></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\">Lembre que o sistema UTM divide a Terra em zonas e as coordenadas se repetem entre zonas, inclusive entre hemisférios. Por isso vc deve indicar as coordenadas e a zona específica. Veja as funções que vc consegue trasformar de UTM pra lat/long e plotar.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\">Abs</div><div></div><div> </div><div><font face=\"courier, monaco, monospace, sans-serif\" size=\"4\" color=\"#007f40\"><div align=\"left\"><font size=\"3\" color=\"#000000\"></font></div></font></div><div align=\"left\"><br></div><div align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:arial,helvetica,clean,sans-serif;background-color:transparent\"><font style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:bold\"><b>Matheus Ribeiro<span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255)\">*****</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre\">\t</span></b></font><font style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px\"><font style=\"color:rgb(162,162,162);font-weight:bold\">Laboratório de Macroecologia | Universidade Federal de Goiás | <span style=\"font-style:italic\">Campus</span> Jataí</font></font></div><div align=\"left\" style=\"background-color:transparent;font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255)\">*********************</span><span style=\"color:rgb(162,162,162);white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(162,162,162)\">Rua Riachuelo | no. 1530 | Setor Samuel Graham | </span><font style=\"color:rgb(162,162,162)\"><font><span style=\"line-height:16px\">CxP 03 | </span></font></font><span style=\"color:rgb(162,162,162);line-height:16px\">75.804-020</span></span></div><div align=\"left\" style=\"background-color:transparent;font-style:normal;font-size:10px;