in-top:5px;padding-left:5px\">  <div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"> <div style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-size:12pt\"> <div dir=\"ltr\"> <font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"> <hr size=\"1\">  <b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">De:</span></b> Luciano F. Sgarbi &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">luciano....@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br> <b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Para:</span></b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">r-eco...@googlegroups.com</a> <br> <b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Enviadas:</span></b> Quarta-feira, 9 de Janeiro de 2013 18:58<br> <b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Assunto:</span></b> [R-Ecology] Corrigir coordenadas UTM de acordo com a zona pertencente<br> </font> </div> <br><div></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
